  "welcomeTitle": "Welcome, Dungeon Master!",
  "welcomeSystemIntro": "Dungeon Master Tool is a portable, offline-first tabletop companion. The Hub has six sections: Social (feed, messages, marketplace), Settings (account, theme, language, cloud sync), Worlds (campaigns with battle map, mind map, entities and sessions), Characters (every character you own across worlds), Templates (game skeletons you spin worlds from) and Packages (drop-in content bundles).",
  "welcomeOnlinePlay": "Online play is open to everyone with an account. Your players see exactly what you share with them — the cards you hand out and whatever you put on the shared screen — live, as you share it. The rest of your world stays yours.",
